  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancing agrifood negotiations</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the project is to generate knowledge to support agriculture negotiators in developing countries to address key issues related to agriculture, food systems, and food security. The support provided will also facilitate exchanges of experts from developing (Non-Annex I), emerging and developed countries (Annex I). Project activities will seek to enhance negotiators&apos; capacities and coordination, enabling them to participate effectively and contribute meaningfully at the 29th Conference of the Parties (COP 29) to the UNFCCC in November 2024, and at the 62nd Session of the Subsidiary Bodies (SB 62) to the UNFCCC in June 2025</narrative>
  </description>
